msgstr "Microsoft Azure Machine Learning Studio {#microsoft-azure-machine-learning-studio}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create an Azure account](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/azure/create-azure-account).\n"
msgstr "[Crie uma conta Azure](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/azure/create-azure-account).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a workspace](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/machine-learning/concept-workspace?view=azureml-api-2#create-a-workspace).\n"
msgstr "[Crie um workspace](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/machine-learning/concept-workspace?view=azureml-api-2#create-a-workspace).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a Jupyter notebook in your workspace](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/machine-learning/how-to-run-jupyter-notebooks?view=azureml-api-2).\n"
msgstr "[Crie um notebook Jupyter no seu workspace](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/machine-learning/how-to-run-jupyter-notebooks?view=azureml-api-2).\n"

